what is the QA of this pattern and how it apply it on the project ? make it short
------------AI Response------------
QA Benefits (The "Why")
⚬	Isolated Testing: QA can test one strategy (e.g., SMS) independently without worrying about breaking others.
⚬	Easy Mocking: You can inject a fake strategy during testing to verify core logic without triggering real actions (like actually sending an SMS).
⚬	Fewer Regression Bugs: Because of the Open/Closed Principle, adding a new feature means creating a new class rather than altering old code, heavily reducing the chance of new bugs.

